t(1, 1085, """The most astray of Allah's creatures I have seen in my life are people who make prophecies: to them, by a feeling of the heart, this one is of the people of Paradise and that one of the people of the Fire! How bold they are against Allah! They are advised and reminded of the truth and of what is right, yet they exalt themselves and are too proud for advice. These transgressors against one of the attributes of the Lord, the Great Creator, do not know how much disbelief they commit, and how much harm they do to the people around them, hurting them in those they love most! Such people in your homes and in your lives, if they exist, are too rare to be a visible multitude; if they exist, and I doubt they exceed 1% of people, one must not stay silent about their disbelief in Allah and their boldness in classifying so-and-so as of the people of Paradise or of the people of the Fire merely because their sinful hearts felt a feeling! For their persistence will bring them to complete disbelief, like Musaylima and like Sajah.""")

t(1, 1700, """Everything old will be erased by the power of our Lord, for that is the way of our Great Lord on earth! Almost all of it! For no Ummah rises upon crookedness of minds! If one leafing through the pages reflected on what he hears and sees of the crookedness of minds among groups - in quotation marks "political Islam", headed by the Brotherhood - who fight, and may even raise their voices in anger, against applying the hadiths of the Prophet ﷺ to their group; and if he reflected on the ruin of thought and method among the failed groups of political Islam, whom Allah Almighty did not grant success because they refuse to ponder the hadiths of His Messenger and Prophet ﷺ; and if he looked around him, he would discover that these whom he sees and who appear are (the elite)! With known names, known faces and known personalities! They are an elite because they managed to reach our screens! If he reflected on that, the calculation is very simple .. an Ummah that will rise in the coming days and years on a sound method, while these have ruined minds; so how can the two sides meet?! This is the greatest proof that all the present names, nearly all of them, will vanish and be erased, and will have no role and no existence on earth in the Ummah's future, for to this very day they remain on their old political misguidance .. Appearing before the screen does not mean that a person's mind is sound and his thought correct! Far from it .. What is seen on the screen is terrifying: the mind's deviation from pondering even reality .. What is seen is everyone with an opinion admiring his own opinion (an opinion, not a governing, decisive text) .. Among their deeds is a distortion of the texts that they insist on, to serve political projects for which they are not fit in the first place. They are the ones who want destiny to soften for them as iron softened in the hands of Allah's prophet Dawud, peace be upon him! But destiny does not soften, because it is not iron but a divine compulsion over the servants, in spite of them! For Allah Almighty has ways on His earth .. clear ways .. The prophet Dawud, peace be upon him, was at the start an individual and not a group .. Our Prophet ﷺ was at the start an individual and not a group! The prophet Musa, peace be upon him, was at the start an individual and not a group! As for groups, in the way of Allah they are not a good that history has recorded .. Pharaoh was a group (disbelieving) .. The transgressing party was a group (Muslims) .. The Abbasid revolution was a group (Muslims) .. Then Ertugrul was a weak individual, then he had a group, and a state arose that was not on the prophetic method but did not shed blood …""")

t(2, 155, """… like the first two, a monarchy! Every rising upon truth, justice and rightness is only a rising through one individual, not through a group .. And every ruin is a ruin through a group .. Wake up, O groups of political Islam .. Soon you will realise that what is coming for you is from your home to the mosque .. and from the mosque to the home .. Yet you still dream of ruling the Ummah, while you are among the most ignorant of politics of all people in human history!""")

t(2, 665, """A Muslim woman's going out of her home - as long as she is not going to a sin, is not going out to commit a wrong, and goes out with the permission of her guardian, if he exists and is available - this going out is a fixed, firmly rooted principle among the principles of the human right of both sexes .. the right to walk the earth's paths .. For the noble verse did not address the man alone .. it is for women as for men. To say that the basic rule is that a woman goes out only for a need, as the overstrict who go to extremes in this religion say, is a statement contrary to the texts of the Book and the Sunnah. What came regarding the Mothers of the Believers, texts about staying in their houses, are texts that do not apply to the women of this Ummah; they were texts specific to the Mothers of the Believers alone. Every sensible woman goes out for a necessity anyway, and necessities are of many kinds; every need, even a trivial one, is a necessity as long as it does not lead to a sin or disobedience. For people themselves are the ones who assess their needs; no one assesses them for them, not even a mufti or a Shaykh al-Islam! Accordingly there is no confinement of women in Islam, as said by the hardliners who did not understand the texts well and went to excess in understanding until they ruined people's lives. Peoples and tribes snatched this up from them, exploiting the fact that such words came from respected figures of religious discourse, as though they were happy and glad at this injustice inflicted on the Muslim woman in many parts of the Islamic world. Fathers and husbands were obstinate with their women and deprived them of a human right to move about the earth; they shackled them with restrictions, were harsh with them, and showed no leniency towards their women's requests to go out for what is no sin and is obedience; they deemed a woman's leaving the house to be either to visit her family or to the grave when she dies. Islam is innocent of this, and of all these, muftis and those given the fatwas, we declare our innocence before Allah Almighty.""")

t(3, 605, """When he was ill and under treatment, I made two supplications for Waseem Yousef. One of them I published here, praying: O Allah, heal him of his illness - and praise be to Allah, the prayer was answered. The second I kept within myself and did not publish, and I ask Allah Almighty to answer it.""")

t(3, 1065, """When people sleep and sleep has fled, when worries weigh heavy and your burdens grow great, when your soul groans and sobs in silence: in the orphanages there are mercies dwelling and abiding that fill the place and make it unlike your home; with them a soul finds calm that has prostrated to Allah and then wished to show love to Allah in the weakest of His creation, in those He loves! There are the most tender of souls .. no father and no mother .. no aunt on either side .. no grandfather and no grandmother .. There live the boys and girls who dream of a future unlike the future of children in their families' homes! There are delicate, innocent souls that have seen almost nothing of what life does! They have not learned what discord between father and mother, aunts, grandfather and grandmother, and uncles means! There are souls from another world! There the groaning of your spirit will lessen, there the worries of life will be forgotten, and many of your deep, stubborn wounds will heal!""")

t(4, 300, """Abraha after Abraha! As for the first Abraha, his head was smashed by birds in flocks; as for the second Abraha, he is smaller than that! His head will be smashed without a sign from Allah, because he is too small for a sign to be sent down upon him. And when Allah Almighty wills safety for oppressed people who have no power against iron or even against wood, people wake to astonishing news that they never thought would happen one day, and they witness things the opposite of which their fathers and grandfathers lived through for decades followed by decades! For approaching certain places on earth is forbidden. So when Abraha's soldiers camp near a place or places, he is not going to enter them, for it is never fitting for him, just as it was not fitting for the first Abraha and he was not allowed to enter. And just as the first Abraha was shattered, his nose broken, his head smashed, and he vanished into history .. the nose and head of the second Abraha will be broken, and history will fold him away. Between Abraha and Abraha there is one story .. the rising of a religion and the revival of an Ummah .. So to everyone who dwells in places that the Abraha of the end of time must not enter .. be at ease .. Abraha will never enter upon you, by the power of Allah Almighty, even if he owned the whole earth!""")

t(4, 2395, """Al-Muhammadiyyah .. the lost city in every Muslim land! Lost for 1447 years!""")

t(5, 1320, """On that day he will not be a rebel but one who commands .. For there cannot be two equal poles on earth without humanity losing safety and ease; one pole must rise above the other, one bow must be drawn tighter than the other, and one voice must bow to the other!""")

t(6, 400, """When the Rock meets the pulpit, blessed on that day will be the men and the women who pray upon Mount Moriah""")

t(8, 1085, """I do not celebrate the Gregorian New Year, nor do I offer greetings for it - not because I hate the Christians as brothers in humanity! On the contrary, Christians are, of all the other nations of the earth, the nation closest to coexistence with Muslims, when the Muslims are strong. I do not take part in this celebration with congratulations because it is not the birth of the Messiah the prophet but the birth of the Messiah the Lord and God, and I acknowledge neither the lordship of the Messiah nor his divinity. Had the celebration been of the Messiah the human prophet, the servant of Allah in complete servitude, I would have offered greetings on his birthday without any unease. For the birthday of a human prophet, a servant of Allah, is a symbol of something beautiful; but the symbol of the birth of a lord and a god is something that to me will never be beautiful. So let the Messiah in this yearly celebration be a human prophet, a pure servant of Allah like all the prophets without exception, and perhaps then 2 billion Muslims will offer greetings on his birth, peace be upon him, without any unease.""")

t(8, 1700, """O people of the profit-seeking channels: a few words for the sake of Allah, for which no one asks you any payment .. our reward is only from Allah who created us

Lying has multiplied and spread among you .. so do not write to people: Breaking: such-and-such happened - and then when people enter the recording you tell them: No, of course it did not happen! Whoever says it happened is a liar! People are then between a great liar and a liar, so what is the difference between two liars? O people of the profit-seeking channels .. do not nullify your deeds and extinguish your hearts with an evil act like this, for the believer does not lie; but yes, the Muslim may lie!""")

t(8, 2365, """Tell me more about Islam! What do you know about it? And leave the studio with a valuable prize!""")

t(9, 1300, """How many a lamp of light on the road does a person blow on with his mouth, to darken the road upon himself?!""")

t(10, 275, """A YouTube channel selling Muslims (certificates of answered prayer) for money!

In 1517 Martin Luther became angry with the Church in Rome because it sold people indulgences for money! He said to the Church: You tell people that you are connected to Allah and close to Him, and so, as you say, you pray to Allah for forgiveness for people and He answers you in return for those people paying money to you! But closeness to Allah is supposed to be available "to any Christian"! said Martin!

In 2025 Faraj, the servant in need of Allah, became angry with a channel because its unknown sheikh rejected the advice of Faraj, the servant in need of Allah, out of arrogance towards him and self-admiration, refusing to be advised by someone he sees as weak, worthless and unknown. So the sheikh of that unknown channel persisted in selling supplication to people in return for ill-gotten money. Faraj, the servant in need of Allah, said to that channel: You tell people that your sheikh is connected to Allah, and so he prays for people and his prayer for them is answered in return for people paying money to your channel! But closeness to Allah is supposed to be available "to any Muslim"! said Faraj

1517 - 2025
The indulgences of the Church in Rome
The indulgences of a YouTube channel in manifest misguidance

The likes of these want to commit wrong with no one answering them, no one questioning them and no one advising them; and if any Muslim touches on their errors, they get angry! Go drink from the sea.""")

t(10, 1440, """Reverse migration""")

t(12, 740, """There is no might and no power except with Allah .. We have come to prepare the water hoses before the fire breaks out! An admonition to be deleted after some hours ((only to convey the message)), so the comments will go with the deletion .. Calm down, brother in Islam .. You hardly sleep from the live streams, broadcasting to people without knowledge and in ignorance, and you do not grasp even the ABC of the sciences of the end of time, in what is known of their texts that every person who reads knows! Calm down, brother in Islam .. go easy on yourself .. you are in a surge of anger that has no justification and no cause at all, other than that you have led yourself astray

This very night I saw a vision about an old hater whose hatred began two and a half years ago. He was a follower of the channel in its beginnings; he behaved badly and harassed the followers, men and women, so people complained about him more than once, not just one time, and he was blocked. I saw him tonight in a vision, looking with rancour and spite! It seems you are preparing for the second and third level of rancour and spite. In the vision I reminded you of something incorrect and ill-judged that you did, which reached me about you in 2023 from followers; it was a harassment of people that you committed on (Telegram), so you were blocked. So calm down, brother in Islam .. let your devils calm down! Calm down! How shall I translate it for you, my brother? Calm down .. take a deep breath .. seek refuge in Allah from the accursed Satan .. declare the oneness of Allah Almighty .. say: there is no god but Allah .. remember that the outcome of rancour, hatred and loathing is a destructive outcome when all this rancour gathers in the heart. Perhaps you will read my words before you set off in the feverish marathon of devils begun these two days by the concealed claimant of Mahdihood known as Abu Abdurrahman .. You were blocked from the channel two and a half years ago because of your conduct, your behaviour and people's complaints about you, not because anyone looked down on you, Allah forbid. So weep, my brother, over your sin as we all do, and say what is good or be silent .. and give up backbiting with every evil, for you will attain nothing by this. For if anyone other than you in human history had attained anything through evil, Iblis would have had more right to attain Paradise .. Calm down .. calm down, brother in Islam, not brother of the Arabs .. calm down, for you have a thousand streams in which every day you repeat the very same words 100 times! Calm down before it explodes in your face as it exploded in the face of others!""")

t(12, 1975, """Their future is in the hand of Allah the Great, our Lord, not in the hand of His petty enemies .. For the sake of these, so that they may rejoice, there will be, by the power of Allah Almighty, rounds and charges, and breaking of fingers, breaking of hands, breaking of legs and breaking of heads""")

t(13, 1065, """When your palace is taken as an office for the people, a place of duty and work by day and by night, not as a residence or a bedchamber for your ruler, O Last City .. then you will rise anew, O Quds .. you will rise like a phoenix that never wearies of rising again when its Lord wills it, and is never struck by despair, because you belong to Allah the Lord and to Him you return .. Your story, which no story resembles .. a Muhammadan Solomonic age, with its distinctions and differences, after the Mosaic Solomonic age .. And though both are from one lamp, of one Lord, one Great God and one religion, they are two different laws .. But it is the replacement .. when one nation is replaced by another .. and one branch is replaced by another .. of one root - of Ibrahim, peace be upon him .. So you will rise upon rightness, upon truth and upon justice .. never again to be taken captive .. And with you the whole book of history will be closed! Do you know now how different you are?""")

t(14, 300, """O Allah, heal Sheikh Mustafa.. O Allah, a healing that leaves no illness behind .. O Allah, Lord of mankind, remove the affliction""")

t(14, 1700, """A misguided person enters every day, time and again, with endless usernames, cursing and insulting, and I never answer him, not even within myself .. I block him .. without a reply, and I restrain myself from insulting him even within myself .. This post is for you, so that you know the bill grows heavier day after day! I do not know how you will pay it .. Truly, I do not know how you will pay it on the Day of Resurrection! Your calamity is great.""")

t(14, 2220, """With thinkers who are immersed in libraries, who turn to books in abundance and busy themselves with authorship, written works and reading what writers produce, the mind is manufactured by books; the mind is manufactured binding to binding, cover to cover, board to board. This alone is enough to shrink the mind and keep it from being fully set free, to confine it in the well of scholarly terminology, and to shrink its ability to see horizons that have nothing to do with traditional knowledge and its terms. Nor does this help in deriving a unique understanding, because what the "new" conclusions are built on is entrenched - conclusions resting on the very same style of the people of academic research and academic methods - so in most cases they are of no significance. In all who have lived this academic life in its entirety and with its principles and grown up on it, the second mind is not set in motion! As for the second mind, it is the mind that does not resemble the usual mind! Both the first mind and the second mind, in Islam, are minds that follow the Book and the Sunnah; but the second mind never comes about if the upbringing was an upbringing of books, academic methods, studies, research and a purely, exclusively academic atmosphere.""")

t(15, 455, """A vision about the owner of a channel, which I saw either a year or a year and a half ago .. an old channel specialising in visions, whose owner is dark-skinned

The owner of the channel was stretched out on a bed as if in the throes of death, on his way to death, drawing his last breaths, with a severe interruption of his breathing. So I brought an oxygen mask and placed it over his nose; his condition stabilised and he returned to breathing properly .. I will not answer the question of who he is .. But it is a vision that came true and took place, and the one it concerns knows himself well""")

t(15, 1060, """Allah Almighty grants an opening to a person, and perhaps - in the supposition of us humans - Allah Almighty knew in His unseen that he would relapse. Allah Almighty opens for him a period in which he is connected to Allah, only to carry out a task and a specific role, nothing more; then He leaves him to himself to relapse as he wishes!""")

t(15, 1355, """In people's custom, one thinks the easiest of easy things is for a person to drink a sip of water! That is wrong! The easiest of easy things is for a person to relapse from being connected to Allah Almighty to being cut off from Him! This is easier and faster, a thousand thousand times, than a sip of water!""")

t(15, 1790, """An admonition to the new speakers on the channels, who come out before the people and ((destroy themselves)) out of love and desire for distinction, with what our religion does not accept and our Shari'ah does not approve .. It is especially for a Muslim brother whose thinking has deviated because he follows al-Jawhari and believes everything he says without thinking, owing to a weak capacity for sound inference, the dominance of emotion over the self, emotional impulsiveness and an unbridled sentiment that shuts down the mind and cancels its role! I present a model vision to this brother, that he may ponder and reflect on the danger of what he is in, and to all lovers of wild utterances who are drowning in the delusions of a mistaken understanding of our great religion, that they may turn back! The reason for the post is the emergence of a new speaker from among al-Jawhari's followers whose mind, sadly, has deviated from the straight path because of wild notions that seem to be broadcast in secret in private groups, where mistaken ideas are circulated in which they contradict the fixed principles understood by the early and later scholars firmly grounded in knowledge. Were these not wrong ideas, they would not be circulated in secret like this!

The crisis of the dajjals and the wild utterances of the deluded; the vision I present in this post is for everyone who loves to utter wild things so that it may be said of him: a hero! My dear brother: heroism lies in following the Book of Allah the Great, our Lord, and following the Prophet ﷺ. So this post is for emulation, addressed to those whose minds Satan has turned from what is right and from the path. It is not wrong for a person to present from his own conduct something that can be emulated; that is never self-praise but by way of giving an example for understanding. As for the Shari'ah, it is complete, and the religion is complete. And the jurisprudential issues that confront people through the ages, that arise anew and require ijtihad - their matter belongs to Allah the Great, our Lord, hallowed be His names, glorified in the heavens and on earth and exalted in great exaltation.. Allah Almighty grants an opening to whomever He wills of His servants, the scholars specialised in the sciences of the Shari'ah who have absorbed the sciences of the Shari'ah and of the language (the language of the Qur'an), to understand this religion, to understand what is problematic for the Ummah, and to resolve those issues. And everyone who alters the fixed principles and says: Allah taught me .. Allah informed me .. Allah made me understand - is a liar …""")

t(16, 200, """… against Allah the Great .. Among these are some who alter and change the fixed principles of this religion, established by the Book and the authentic Sunnah, while not knowing how to read the Noble Qur'an!!!!! (an example other than that of this Egyptian brother, for the number on the net is large)

But the lovers of wild utterances do not acknowledge these words and do not like to hear what I am saying; because of inferiority complexes in their social surroundings, because of the love of being seen and standing out among people, and because of the desire to be something in this life by any means, they would love to become prophets after the Prophet ﷺ and messengers after the Prophet ﷺ! For to say: Allah showed me and Allah made known to me - means that you are, literally and not figuratively, claiming prophecy and presenting yourself as a prophet! If one of them sees something in his sleep, he thinks he is one who is spoken to, and his soul rushes into every error of inference and thought. They do not realise that the greatest danger lies in what a person sees - for what he sees he either deems right or otherwise - between the truth of a vision and the lie of a devil! In the past period I saw one of these people - and I feel all pity for him and am angry with him with all anger - coming out before the people and saying: Allah taught me .. Allah showed me .. Allah made me understand .. And if anyone speaks to him about the strange things he says, for which there is no text and no proof, and which indeed contradict the ((consensus)) of all the sects of the Ummah together, he says: thus Allah said to me .. thus Allah showed me .. thus Allah taught me. By Allah, this is indeed manifest misguidance, walking the road of delusion, and relapsing into the way of those who went astray before and whom Satan led astray!

So this is an admonition to this brother - an Egyptian of sound and clean speech: if the reason for this walk of yours on the road of Satan is a vision you saw, then know that it was never a true vision, for nothing that leads a person to misguidance ever came from a true vision! And the greatest proof that you saw dreams from Satan is that you are walking the road of misguidance in altering the fixed principles of the religion in front of everyone, and bringing what neither the early nor the later generations brought throughout 1447, following al-Jawhari, who has no understanding of his religion, that simple man who has nothing to do with the Shari'ah and its jurisprudence.

And the model vision I present to those given to wild utterances, who would love to turn into claimants of prophecy or to attain the ranks of prophethood and messengership after the Prophet ﷺ. The proof that it was a vision, my dear brother, is that you follow this channel over about 4 years, with an invitation to you to bring out of it one single thing contrary to the Book and the Sunnah. For if visions are from Allah Almighty, the path is sound; and if they are from Satan, it is a ruined, barren path. Although it is a vision perhaps 15 years old, today, after these long years, I do not find that it was a cause of my going astray - but that is by the grace of Allah Almighty alone and His granting of success, not by any cleverness of mine nor any merit, Allah forbid; rather the pure, pure, pure grace of Allah. Despite the vision and the years that have passed over it, the method did not deviate! And that is proof that it was a vision. So have you learned, my brother for whom as a Muslim I wish good, what it means to see a true vision as against seeing dreams from Satan?! The vision that was not preceded by any inner talk, of a man absorbed in work 18 hours a day, sleeping the sleep of the slain from the sheer exhaustion of work outside the home and the hardship of the world, so that the one speaking to you could not think of anything at all. Then a noble angel came, lifted the cover of the skull and pointed to the right side of the skull, where there was a hollow, and said: We shall fill this hollow for you! He meant with knowledge .

15 years have passed, and if you are a follower of the channel you will find no wild utterances .. Had this been from Satan, this channel would have been a channel of misguidance. So do not let a Muslim who utters wild things take your mind from you and lead you astray. You seem to be a man of good character, though I do not vouch for you. But this is advice that, Allah willing, will reach you; may it be a cause of your turning back from the road of ruin.""")

h(17, 500, """Our brothers in Sudan are facing a catastrophic situation, but unfortunately Sudan is outside media coverage. O Allah, lift the affliction and hardship from them, O Lord""")

t(17, 1190, """Osama and Ruqayya .. the Jordanian man and the Libyan woman .. in the series of what followers ask me about suspicious channels

A Jordanian man and a Libyan woman, channel owners .. If you come across them on YouTube, know that you are before people cultured in worldly culture; they have a good share of the culture of this world, and also a "not bad" share of ((religious culture)), and not of religious knowledge - and how far apart culture and knowledge are .. For memorising is easy .. memorising information is easy and storing information in the mind is easy .. But understanding information (knowledge) is given only to the disciplined God-fearing, men and women .. These two examples you may find on YouTube .. A Jordanian with a sharp tongue, foul-mouthed in front of everyone, insulting his opponents in obscene words .. And a Libyan woman, mannish (a she-man), who speaks as men speak, indeed more violently than men speak and more harshly than the roughest men speak .. She screams, and her voice reaches the North Pole as she speaks, from the intensity of her vehemence and of her mannishness! Allah Almighty never created woman like this .. And the Shari'ah this woman talks about morning and evening does not permit her that! But memorising is easy and understanding is hard .. memorising is easy and practice is hard, and this woman has corrupted her natural disposition by herself. The Jordanian too talks about the Shari'ah morning and evening .. But what place does the foul tongue have in the Shari'ah? Memorising is easy .. understanding is hard and practice is hard .. These are among those who must be warned against, for from one who is not disciplined by the Shari'ah no Shari'ah is taken, no thought is taken, no understanding, and no benefit can be had from him; because Allah Almighty does not set right the work of the corrupters .. and a person corrupts his work by his deviant conduct.""")

t(17, 2230, """When a man shaves his moustache and face right down, close and closer .. plucking, smoothing and sleeking .. I cannot finish my food .. my stomach turns .. Even the rank of males is hard for a person to reach in this way .. Let these people fear Allah concerning themselves .. And I say to everyone who does this to himself: do not make your image a shaky one in the world of men .. For Allah Almighty did not create the moustache and the beard as a creation surplus to need, so that you should say: I was created wrongly and I will correct the mistake! This does not befit the righteous .. Not everyone who does that is corrupt or bad .. But he is definitely mistaken and not in the right""")

t(18, 235, """East Germany and the slippers crisis!

In the equation of the Cold War play, the Soviet Union saw its seizure of East Germany as a spoil given to it by the West, which had supported it militarily to confront Hitler. Germany had to be broken, and dividing it was important to the West in order to break it. As for the Soviet Union, it was acting internally and externally. On the one hand it acted externally as though in a state of clash with the West, and internally in East Germany, where it tried to calm popular anger caused by the technological progress achieved by its western neighbour. So in the fifties it founded a factory to produce semiconductors, claiming that East Germany would rise technologically; but despite its propaganda it installed managers whose last concern was the success of the East Germans' technical experiment. So much so that when the young East German physicists working in the laboratory asked for "slippers" to be bought for them to use in walking inside the laboratory, so that the place would not be contaminated by their shoes, the management's answer was refusal!""")

t(18, 1085, """Walid Ismail was raised up by the Muslims' desire to make the truth clear and to argue against those who deny it, and Gaza brought him down with the knockout blow""")

t(18, 1375, """Do not listen to Sheikh Wagdy Ghoneim on any political topics, and do not take from him any fatwa relating to the political reality you live in from a religious angle. The man is impulsive, does not grasp the landmarks of the jurisprudence of reality, and is emotional; all of these are traits never suited to giving fatwas. The man has his respect and there is no personal issue with him; we are not discussing his honourable person here, neither now nor in future. But I warn against his method in understanding Shari'ah-based politics, and against what has become plain and evident, clearly and repeatedly: that he is unable to link reality with the religion and its texts, and that he has no connection, near or far, with Shari'ah-based politics and its foundations. This is a brief word to his followers, and the duty has been discharged.""")

t(18, 2010, """Returning to ancient times and attending the birth of Allah's prophet Yusuf, peace be upon him

I was asked about seeing Allah's prophet Yusuf, peace be upon him: whether I saw him as a grown man and what his description is. Here is a brief answer .. I did not see him, peace be upon him, in his childhood, his youth or his adulthood, so I cannot describe him; but 4 years ago I saw him when he was born .. In the vision I was standing in an old house, as though from the ancient era; to my right was a room in which his mother was giving birth to him, though of course I did not see her, and in front of me stood people I did not know, perhaps Allah's prophet Ya'qub, peace be upon him, and the brothers of Yusuf, peace be upon him. When he, peace be upon him, was born, someone brought him from the room where his mother was and gave him to me directly to carry. I took him, carried him in my arms and looked at his face when he had only just been born. The truth is that we see many or few newborns in our lives .. People see newborns in their families and on the internet, as do those who work in maternity hospitals. But a face like the face of Allah's prophet Yusuf as an infant just born is a face of which it is very hard for any of us to say he has seen its like. Not beauty alone, but radiance, roundness and a light like the full moon in its fullness when it lights up the earth; a beauty that tongues are unable to describe. A child with a spirit in him such that you feel you want to "devour" him, so intense is his extraordinary attraction. That vision was on the night when one of the unjust channel owners accused me of lying - reclining, puffed up, his face contorted, in front of his audience, without any fear of Allah Almighty - merely because I had related the vision of Allah's prophet Isa, peace be upon him. A severe sadness came over me …""")
